  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-176",
  "title": "Docket Discussion",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Docket Discussion"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Goal:** Clarify equity allocations, legal structure, fundraising prep, and contributor roles for Docket.tv."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Quick Company Recap"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SaaS platform built under Acme Corp"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "MVP completed; beta tested with Speak MPLS"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Preparing $150K raise in Q2"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Strategic partners: BFresh Productions (growth co-founder), Gumbo Media (advisor/brand partner)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Legal Structure: LLC vs. C-Corp"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Key Question:** Should Acme Corp convert to a Delaware C-Corp?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "LLC: flexible, simple tax handling, fine for bootstrapping"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "C-Corp: necessary for equity issuance, standard for investors"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Timing & legal process for converting to a C-Corp"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Equity Breakdown & Cap Table Planning"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Key Question:** How should equity be divided among contributors and future stakeholders?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Suggested Pre-Funding Allocation:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Role | Equity Range |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| User (Founder) | 80–85% |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| BFresh Productions | 5–10% (vested) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Option Pool (Team) | 10–15% |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Gumbo Media (Advisor) | 0.5–1.5% |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Investors (Post-raise) | ~10–20% dilution |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Establish vesting schedules (4-year with 1-year cliff)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Define deliverables and milestones for BFresh"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Draft roles and responsibilities (advisor vs operational contributor)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. SAFE Notes Overview"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Key Question:** Is a SAFE note the right vehicle for the upcoming raise?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Simple Agreement for Future Equity (SAFE)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No maturity or interest; converts at future priced round"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Valuation cap + optional discount"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use YC SAFE templates or light legal review"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Tools & Infrastructure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Key Question:** What tools should I use to manage equity, contracts, and fundraising?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pulley for cap table and SAFEs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Google Sheets for interim tracking"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Notion or GDrive for managing agreements and templates"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. Open Questions & Prioritization"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-49",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What are the most urgent steps this month?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-50",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Do I need legal counsel now or post-raise?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-51",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When to formalize BFresh and Gumbo roles?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}